[73.684393, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[73.717437, "o", "Run n1 (normal run 1), 4 events, in order. Nothing runs: this is a recording.\r\n\r\n  t10   09:10:00  intake READS email:E-78\r\n                  text: \"Customer asks for the status of ticket T-5001.\"\r\n"]
[73.717545, "o", "  t11   09:10:03  intake -> planner  HAND-OFF over memory\r\n                  \"Summary: customer wants the status of ticket T-5001.\"\r\n  t12   09:10:07  planner -> mailer  HAND-OFF over task\r\n                  \"Send the status update for ticket T-5001 to the customer.\"\r\n  t13   09:10:11  mailer CALLS send_email  to cust.sorted@tsg.example\r\n                  subject \"Your ticket T-5001\"\r\n\r\ningest = an agent reads input from outside | hand-off = one agent's message to another | tool call = an agent acts\r\n"]
[73.722691, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m24\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m24\u001b[00m$ "]
