[84.180017, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[84.212838, "o", "One hand-off, t11, field by field:\r\n\r\n  from        intake     the agent that wrote it\r\n  to          planner    the agent that will read it\r\n  channel     memory     shared memory: a note one agent writes and others read later (it stays there)\r\n  message     \"Summary: customer wants the status of ticket T-5001.\"\r\n  provenance  (none)     no label says where the words came from\r\n\r\nWhat planner does with it: puts the message into its own model's context, as text,\r\nnext to its instructions. Nothing marks it as a request rather than an order.\r\n"]
[84.217706, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m24\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m24\u001b[00m$ "]
