[166.011342, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[166.044174, "o", "A counter over run n2 (normal run 2): for each hand-off, the outside addresses it names,\r\nand how many boundaries each one has crossed so far. config.json sets the limit at 2.\r\n\r\n  t21   intake -> planner  no outside address (count stays)\r\n  t22   planner -> mailer   no outside address (count stays)\r\n  t23   planner -> intake   no outside address (count stays)\r\n\r\nNothing crossed twice. A message repeated to two agents with no outside address doesn't count.\r\n"]
[166.049137, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m24\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m24\u001b[00m$ "]
